  "authoringNote": "Migrated from F08a; expectations re-derived under pack v2. The attachment f08a-attachment v1 (an encounter-kind record) has metadata subjectId SYN-BEN-X801, not the case subject, so R02 quarantines that exact version on the metadata_subject basis whatever its R09 result; its body is not compared, and R09 does not report it (R09 applicability). R02 is conflict with one condition (binding.metadata_subject, attachment v1); its parent set and the quarantine list are exactly that version (C07, D3). The attachment contributes no fact and is never cited, so R04 and R06 read only f08a-encounter: final encounter 2026-08-14 and final order 2026-08-28 share SYN-PRAC-0001 and are sequenced; the receipt 2026-08-29T16:40:00Z follows the span end 2026-08-29T12:00Z. R01, R03, R04, R05, R07, R08 and R09 pass with ordinary citations; R02 cites the six beneficiary facts of the encounter, order and receipt. State needs_human_review, as in v1. v2 replaces the document ID list with the exact version reference and adds the binding-basis condition.",
